>
>
> ma selma'o zo za'o
>
>
> (I hope that's correct Lojban?)
>


la'e zo za'o  I think is probably the correct answer, although I'm not sure
that's quite been settled by the lojbanic community.



> And what are the other word classes?
>

  Well the front page of vlasisku ( http://vlasisku.lojban.org/ ) give you
a nice cloud of them


